{"id":"forecast-04","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-04/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":573.07,"segments":[{"start":0.24,"end":7.26,"text":"Section 4. You will hear part of a lecture given by an art and design lecturer on the topic","words":[["Section",0.24,0.86],["4.",0.86,1.4],["You",2.04,2.58],["will",2.58,2.74],["hear",2.74,2.98],["part",2.98,3.28],["of",3.28,3.44],["a",3.44,3.56],["lecture",3.56,3.86],["given",3.86,4.54],["by",4.54,4.82],["an",4.82,4.98],["art",4.98,5.22],["and",5.22,5.4],["design",5.4,5.78],["lecturer",5.78,6.28],["on",6.28,6.82],["the",6.82,6.94],["topic",6.94,7.26]]},{"start":7.26,"end":14.1,"text":"of Aboriginal textile design in Australia. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["of",7.26,7.52],["Aboriginal",7.52,7.92],["textile",7.92,8.52],["design",8.52,9.32],["in",9.32,9.7],["Australia.",9.7,10.14],["First,",11.44,11.86],["you",12.32,12.48],["have",12.48,12.66],["some",12.66,12.86],["time",12.86,13.24],["to",13.24,13.44],["look",13.44,13.56],["at",13.56,13.7],["questions",13.7,14.1]]},{"start":14.1,"end":72.4,"text":"31 to 40 on page 7. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["31",14.1,15.08],["to",15.08,15.56],["40",15.56,16.02],["on",16.02,16.66],["page",16.66,16.9],["7.",16.9,17.32],["Now",67.96,68.3],["listen",68.3,68.64],["carefully",68.64,69.12],["and",69.12,69.62],["answer",69.62,69.92],["questions",69.92,70.4],["31",70.4,71.44],["to",71.44,71.98],["40.",71.98,72.4]]},{"start":76.02,"end":82.86,"text":"The Indigenous people of Australia, or Aboriginals, have a long history of using animal and","words":[["The",76.02,76.42],["Indigenous",76.42,76.9],["people",76.9,77.42],["of",77.42,77.72],["Australia,",77.72,78.22],["or",78.6,78.92],["Aboriginals,",78.92,79.66],["have",80.22,80.54],["a",80.54,80.66],["long",80.66,80.94],["history",80.94,81.4],["of",81.4,81.78],["using",81.78,82.06],["animal",82.06,82.54],["and",82.54,82.86]]},{"start":82.86,"end":90.02,"text":"plant fibres to make a variety of fabric. Over the years, their traditional designs and stories","words":[["plant",82.86,83.2],["fibres",83.2,83.92],["to",83.92,84.28],["make",84.28,84.48],["a",84.48,84.6],["variety",84.6,85.08],["of",85.08,85.44],["fabric.",85.44,85.8],["Over",86.88,87.24],["the",87.24,87.4],["years,",87.4,87.8],["their",87.98,88.2],["traditional",88.2,88.7],["designs",88.7,89.32],["and",89.32,89.52],["stories",89.52,90.02]]},{"start":90.02,"end":97.26,"text":"have been incorporated into various textiles. The Urna-Bella Arts Centre is a place where local","words":[["have",90.02,90.64],["been",90.64,90.8],["incorporated",90.8,91.28],["into",91.28,91.76],["various",91.76,92.18],["textiles.",92.18,92.94],["The",94.12,94.24],["Urna",94.24,94.58],["-Bella",94.58,94.86],["Arts",94.86,95.28],["Centre",95.28,95.64],["is",95.64,96.24],["a",96.24,96.36],["place",96.36,96.62],["where",96.62,96.96],["local",96.96,97.26]]},{"start":97.26,"end":103.72,"text":"aboriginals can produce their traditional craft and also learn new techniques to decorate fabric.","words":[["aboriginals",97.26,97.98],["can",97.98,98.48],["produce",98.48,98.9],["their",98.9,99.24],["traditional",99.24,99.78],["craft",99.78,100.28],["and",100.28,100.84],["also",100.84,101.32],["learn",101.32,101.68],["new",101.68,101.98],["techniques",101.98,102.5],["to",102.5,102.8],["decorate",102.8,103.16],["fabric.",103.16,103.72]]},{"start":104.48,"end":109.54,"text":"For the first 30 years, the artists crafted rugs working with wool.","words":[["For",104.48,104.78],["the",104.78,104.92],["first",104.92,105.26],["30",105.26,105.7],["years,",105.7,106.16],["the",106.5,106.66],["artists",106.66,107.14],["crafted",107.14,107.74],["rugs",107.74,108.28],["working",108.28,108.94],["with",108.94,109.18],["wool.",109.18,109.54]]},{"start":110.56,"end":116.82,"text":"These rugs incorporated their own unique designs. However, as they became less","words":[["These",110.56,111.28],["rugs",111.28,111.82],["incorporated",111.82,112.56],["their",112.56,113.06],["own",113.06,113.36],["unique",113.36,113.68],["designs.",113.68,114.28],["However,",114.94,115.36],["as",115.84,116.0],["they",116.0,116.14],["became",116.14,116.54],["less",116.54,116.82]]},{"start":116.82,"end":121.44,"text":"economical to produce, the artists were introduced to Batik, which is an","words":[["economical",116.82,117.38],["to",117.38,117.7],["produce,",117.7,118.12],["the",118.68,118.76],["artists",118.76,119.12],["were",119.12,119.38],["introduced",119.38,119.8],["to",119.8,120.14],["Batik,",120.14,120.56],["which",120.9,121.16],["is",121.16,121.3],["an",121.3,121.44]]},{"start":121.44,"end":127.66,"text":"Indonesian method of dyeing textiles. Batik is quicker than weaving, so many of","words":[["Indonesian",121.44,121.98],["method",121.98,122.54],["of",122.54,122.8],["dyeing",122.8,123.32],["textiles.",123.32,124.02],["Batik",124.84,125.44],["is",125.44,125.66],["quicker",125.66,126.04],["than",126.04,126.26],["weaving,",126.26,126.66],["so",126.98,127.1],["many",127.1,127.38],["of",127.38,127.66]]},{"start":127.66,"end":132.76,"text":"the Urna Bella artists started to produce it themselves. Screen printing","words":[["the",127.66,127.8],["Urna",127.8,128.08],["Bella",128.08,128.3],["artists",128.3,129.0],["started",129.0,129.5],["to",129.5,129.72],["produce",129.72,130.06],["it",130.06,130.28],["themselves.",130.28,130.76],["Screen",131.74,132.22],["printing",132.22,132.76]]},{"start":132.76,"end":137.12,"text":"was later introduced to the centre, and Urna Bella's artists were commissioned","words":[["was",132.76,133.04],["later",133.04,133.34],["introduced",133.34,133.78],["to",133.78,134.14],["the",134.14,134.26],["centre,",134.26,134.56],["and",135.18,135.38],["Urna",135.38,135.66],["Bella's",135.66,136.06],["artists",136.06,136.46],["were",136.46,136.7],["commissioned",136.7,137.12]]},{"start":137.12,"end":142.88,"text":"to produce fabric for furniture that was to be used at popular tourist destinations such as","words":[["to",137.12,137.32],["produce",137.32,137.64],["fabric",137.64,138.08],["for",138.08,138.38],["furniture",138.38,138.8],["that",138.8,139.38],["was",139.38,139.52],["to",139.52,139.68],["be",139.68,139.8],["used",139.8,140.2],["at",140.2,140.38],["popular",140.38,140.72],["tourist",140.72,141.2],["destinations",141.2,142.0],["such",142.0,142.7],["as",142.7,142.88]]},{"start":142.88,"end":149.68,"text":"the National Park Offices at Uluru. Screen printing has also been used successfully by the Tiwi people","words":[["the",142.88,143.0],["National",143.0,143.26],["Park",143.26,143.72],["Offices",143.72,144.3],["at",144.3,144.74],["Uluru.",144.74,145.16],["Screen",146.04,146.48],["printing",146.48,146.92],["has",146.92,147.16],["also",147.16,147.52],["been",147.52,147.72],["used",147.72,147.92],["successfully",147.92,148.5],["by",148.5,148.78],["the",148.78,148.92],["Tiwi",148.92,149.28],["people",149.28,149.68]]},{"start":149.68,"end":156.74,"text":"who live on islands north of Darwin. Their company Tiwi Designs produces fabric that is inspired","words":[["who",149.68,150.32],["live",150.32,150.46],["on",150.46,150.64],["islands",150.64,151.08],["north",151.08,151.5],["of",151.5,151.72],["Darwin.",151.72,152.02],["Their",152.78,152.94],["company",152.94,153.34],["Tiwi",153.34,153.94],["Designs",153.94,154.7],["produces",154.7,155.12],["fabric",155.12,155.8],["that",155.8,156.04],["is",156.04,156.16],["inspired",156.16,156.74]]},{"start":156.74,"end":164.24,"text":"by their surroundings. For example, they incorporated bird motifs into their early designs.","words":[["by",156.74,157.02],["their",157.02,157.22],["surroundings.",157.22,157.72],["For",158.6,158.82],["example,",158.82,159.4],["they",160.06,160.28],["incorporated",160.28,161.22],["bird",161.22,161.66],["motifs",161.66,162.5],["into",162.5,162.96],["their",162.96,163.22],["early",163.22,163.56],["designs.",163.56,164.24]]},{"start":165.48,"end":171.1,"text":"Tewee art, culture and language are very different from those of mainland Aboriginal groups.","words":[["Tewee",165.48,166.16],["art,",166.16,166.34],["culture",166.54,166.82],["and",166.82,167.12],["language",167.12,167.54],["are",167.54,167.84],["very",167.84,168.24],["different",168.24,168.64],["from",168.64,168.88],["those",168.88,169.1],["of",169.1,169.32],["mainland",169.32,169.76],["Aboriginal",169.76,170.44],["groups.",170.44,171.1]]},{"start":171.64,"end":176.2,"text":"The patterns on their fabric are related to the beliefs and legends in their culture.","words":[["The",171.64,171.88],["patterns",171.88,172.28],["on",172.28,172.48],["their",172.48,172.6],["fabric",172.6,173.02],["are",173.02,173.56],["related",173.56,173.88],["to",173.88,174.14],["the",174.14,174.26],["beliefs",174.26,174.68],["and",174.68,175.06],["legends",175.06,175.4],["in",175.4,175.74],["their",175.74,175.86],["culture.",175.86,176.2]]},{"start":176.98,"end":182.46,"text":"For example, some textile designs are chosen because they are thought to cause rain.","words":[["For",176.98,177.2],["example,",177.2,177.66],["some",178.3,178.58],["textile",178.58,178.98],["designs",178.98,179.58],["are",179.58,179.72],["chosen",179.72,180.14],["because",180.14,180.74],["they",180.74,181.02],["are",181.02,181.16],["thought",181.16,181.4],["to",181.4,181.6],["cause",181.6,181.92],["rain.",181.92,182.46]]},{"start":190.4,"end":194.3,"text":"Another successful Aboriginal design company was founded by Jimmy Pike.","words":[["Another",190.4,190.7],["successful",190.7,191.24],["Aboriginal",191.24,191.7],["design",191.7,192.22],["company",192.22,192.72],["was",192.72,192.96],["founded",192.96,193.34],["by",193.34,193.58],["Jimmy",193.58,193.88],["Pike.",193.88,194.3]]},{"start":194.3,"end":200.18,"text":"his dynamic prints, paintings and fabrics are greatly influenced by the","words":[["his",194.3,195.44],["dynamic",195.44,195.96],["prints,",195.96,196.58],["paintings",196.94,197.34],["and",197.34,197.74],["fabrics",197.74,198.2],["are",198.2,198.46],["greatly",198.46,198.8],["influenced",198.8,199.36],["by",199.36,200.0],["the",200.0,200.18]]},{"start":200.18,"end":205.9,"text":"Australian landscape, in particular that of the desert which is often featured in","words":[["Australian",200.18,200.7],["landscape,",200.7,201.46],["in",201.82,202.02],["particular",202.02,202.62],["that",202.62,203.14],["of",203.14,203.46],["the",203.46,203.58],["desert",203.58,203.84],["which",203.84,204.52],["is",204.52,204.68],["often",204.68,205.08],["featured",205.08,205.54],["in",205.54,205.9]]},{"start":205.9,"end":212.66,"text":"this work. Pike worked with acrylic paint, oil pastels and screen printing.","words":[["this",205.9,206.08],["work.",206.08,206.44],["Pike",207.76,208.12],["worked",208.12,208.72],["with",208.72,209.06],["acrylic",209.06,209.3],["paint,",209.3,209.86],["oil",210.32,210.62],["pastels",210.62,211.34],["and",211.34,211.72],["screen",211.72,212.16],["printing.",212.16,212.66]]},{"start":213.84,"end":219.56,"text":"Surprisingly Jimmy Pike's life as an artist began in prison where he was","words":[["Surprisingly",213.84,214.64],["Jimmy",214.64,215.38],["Pike's",215.38,216.0],["life",216.0,216.3],["as",216.3,216.54],["an",216.54,216.66],["artist",216.66,217.04],["began",217.04,217.8],["in",217.8,218.12],["prison",218.12,218.56],["where",218.56,219.26],["he",219.26,219.4],["was",219.4,219.56]]},{"start":219.56,"end":226.64,"text":"serving a sentence for murder. The art teachers there recognized his talent and gave him the","words":[["serving",219.56,219.98],["a",219.98,220.14],["sentence",220.14,220.5],["for",220.5,220.86],["murder.",220.86,221.18],["The",222.6,222.9],["art",222.9,223.16],["teachers",223.16,223.48],["there",223.48,223.92],["recognized",223.92,224.66],["his",224.66,225.16],["talent",225.16,225.58],["and",225.58,226.08],["gave",226.08,226.34],["him",226.34,226.52],["the",226.52,226.64]]},{"start":226.64,"end":234.18,"text":"technical skills he needed to become a successful artist. After Pike's release, he started his own","words":[["technical",226.64,227.06],["skills",227.06,227.52],["he",227.52,227.72],["needed",227.72,228.14],["to",228.14,228.6],["become",228.6,228.9],["a",228.9,229.08],["successful",229.08,229.44],["artist.",229.44,230.02],["After",231.04,231.58],["Pike's",231.58,232.12],["release,",232.12,232.58],["he",233.04,233.16],["started",233.16,233.56],["his",233.56,233.82],["own",233.82,234.18]]},{"start":234.18,"end":240.02,"text":"company aiming to create a product that would sell well commercially but still retain its","words":[["company",234.18,234.7],["aiming",234.7,235.4],["to",235.4,235.66],["create",235.66,236.0],["a",236.0,236.24],["product",236.24,236.66],["that",236.66,236.92],["would",236.92,237.1],["sell",237.1,237.44],["well",237.44,237.78],["commercially",237.78,238.4],["but",238.4,239.02],["still",239.02,239.34],["retain",239.34,239.82],["its",239.82,240.02]]},{"start":240.02,"end":246.32,"text":"aboriginal cultural identity. Eventually, he decided to bring his artwork onto textiles","words":[["aboriginal",240.02,240.68],["cultural",240.68,241.28],["identity.",241.28,242.04],["Eventually,",242.8,243.4],["he",243.58,243.8],["decided",243.8,244.22],["to",244.22,244.44],["bring",244.44,244.62],["his",244.62,244.8],["artwork",244.8,245.26],["onto",245.26,245.68],["textiles",245.68,246.32]]},{"start":246.32,"end":248.38,"text":"which were used to produce clothing.","words":[["which",246.32,246.78],["were",246.78,246.98],["used",246.98,247.28],["to",247.28,247.5],["produce",247.5,247.8],["clothing.",247.8,248.38]]},{"start":249.18,"end":252.18,"text":"The designs he selected were transferred onto cotton","words":[["The",249.18,249.36],["designs",249.36,249.86],["he",249.86,250.06],["selected",250.06,250.52],["were",250.52,250.76],["transferred",250.76,251.36],["onto",251.36,251.74],["cotton",251.74,252.18]]},{"start":252.18,"end":254.92,"text":"and had both a strong linear character","words":[["and",252.18,252.84],["had",252.84,253.08],["both",253.08,253.3],["a",253.3,253.48],["strong",253.48,253.92],["linear",253.92,254.28],["character",254.28,254.92]]},{"start":254.92,"end":256.64,"text":"and a good color range.","words":[["and",254.92,255.34],["a",255.34,255.46],["good",255.46,255.76],["color",255.76,256.14],["range.",256.14,256.64]]},{"start":258.06,"end":260.96,"text":"Bronwyn Bancroft is one of the most successful","words":[["Bronwyn",258.06,258.78],["Bancroft",258.78,259.5],["is",259.5,259.72],["one",259.72,259.92],["of",259.92,260.02],["the",260.02,260.12],["most",260.12,260.3],["successful",260.3,260.96]]},{"start":260.96,"end":263.56,"text":"Aboriginal artists and designers to date.","words":[["Aboriginal",260.96,261.48],["artists",261.48,262.1],["and",262.1,262.46],["designers",262.46,262.98],["to",262.98,263.3],["date.",263.3,263.56]]},{"start":264.28,"end":267.08,"text":"She has produced a great deal of artwork and textiles","words":[["She",264.28,264.46],["has",264.46,264.66],["produced",264.66,265.04],["a",265.04,265.26],["great",265.26,265.48],["deal",265.48,265.7],["of",265.7,265.82],["artwork",265.82,266.2],["and",266.2,266.5],["textiles",266.5,267.08]]},{"start":267.42,"end":269.6,"text":"and many of her paintings are held","words":[["and",267.42,267.78],["many",267.78,268.1],["of",268.1,268.26],["her",268.26,268.4],["paintings",268.4,268.82],["are",268.82,269.38],["held",269.38,269.6]]},{"start":269.6,"end":271.36,"text":"by Australian art galleries.","words":[["by",269.6,269.86],["Australian",269.86,270.44],["art",270.44,270.88],["galleries.",270.88,271.36]]},{"start":272.2,"end":274.7,"text":"Her work reflects her Aboriginal roots","words":[["Her",272.2,272.46],["work",272.46,272.78],["reflects",272.78,273.32],["her",273.32,273.58],["Aboriginal",273.58,274.1],["roots",274.1,274.7]]},{"start":274.7,"end":280.7,"text":"but always with a contemporary fresh view of family and the natural environment.","words":[["but",274.7,275.3],["always",275.3,275.82],["with",275.82,276.08],["a",276.08,276.22],["contemporary",276.22,276.86],["fresh",276.86,277.32],["view",277.32,277.9],["of",277.9,278.42],["family",278.42,278.98],["and",278.98,279.52],["the",279.52,279.64],["natural",279.64,280.0],["environment.",280.0,280.7]]},{"start":281.32,"end":287.44,"text":"In 1995, she was chosen by a charity organisation to paint a pair of jeans","words":[["In",281.32,281.72],["1995,",281.72,282.44],["she",282.8,283.38],["was",283.38,283.54],["chosen",283.54,283.94],["by",283.94,284.26],["a",284.26,284.42],["charity",284.42,284.68],["organisation",284.68,285.62],["to",285.62,286.2],["paint",286.2,286.48],["a",286.48,286.7],["pair",286.7,286.86],["of",286.86,287.04],["jeans",287.04,287.44]]},{"start":287.44,"end":292.28,"text":"owned by Kathy Freeman, a famous Aboriginal Australian athlete.","words":[["owned",287.44,288.14],["by",288.14,288.36],["Kathy",288.36,288.76],["Freeman,",288.76,289.22],["a",289.7,289.94],["famous",289.94,290.2],["Aboriginal",290.2,290.9],["Australian",290.9,291.76],["athlete.",291.76,292.28]]},{"start":292.82,"end":297.02,"text":"She used imagery of lizards moving quickly over the Australian terrain","words":[["She",292.82,293.1],["used",293.1,293.44],["imagery",293.44,293.94],["of",293.94,294.32],["lizards",294.32,294.7],["moving",294.7,295.0],["quickly",295.0,295.46],["over",295.46,295.86],["the",295.86,296.02],["Australian",296.02,296.54],["terrain",296.54,297.02]]},{"start":297.4,"end":301.34,"text":"and she added a rainbow which represents the optimism","words":[["and",297.4,297.8],["she",297.8,298.0],["added",298.0,298.28],["a",298.28,298.54],["rainbow",298.54,298.9],["which",298.9,299.68],["represents",299.68,300.32],["the",300.32,300.7],["optimism",300.7,301.34]]},{"start":301.34,"end":304.8,"text":"that Kathy symbolizes for all Aboriginal people.","words":[["that",301.34,301.88],["Kathy",301.88,302.22],["symbolizes",302.22,302.98],["for",302.98,303.32],["all",303.32,303.64],["Aboriginal",303.64,304.16],["people.",304.16,304.8]]},{"start":305.6,"end":309.2,"text":"In 2001, she was chosen to design costumes","words":[["In",305.6,305.82],["2001,",305.82,306.76],["she",307.26,307.46],["was",307.46,307.64],["chosen",307.64,308.16],["to",308.16,308.38],["design",308.38,308.74],["costumes",308.74,309.2]]},{"start":309.2,"end":313.48,"text":"for the opening of the Biggest Street Parade ever held in Australia,","words":[["for",309.2,309.54],["the",309.54,309.62],["opening",309.62,310.08],["of",310.08,310.3],["the",310.3,310.42],["Biggest",310.42,310.84],["Street",310.84,311.2],["Parade",311.2,311.8],["ever",311.8,312.4],["held",312.4,312.82],["in",312.82,313.02],["Australia,",313.02,313.48]]},{"start":314.06,"end":315.88,"text":"the Journey of a Nation Parade.","words":[["the",314.06,314.12],["Journey",314.12,314.52],["of",314.52,314.82],["a",314.82,314.96],["Nation",314.96,315.24],["Parade.",315.24,315.88]]},{"start":316.44,"end":321.1,"text":"The People in Bancroft section of the parade all wore an outfit she designed.","words":[["The",316.44,316.66],["People",316.66,316.96],["in",316.96,317.2],["Bancroft",317.2,317.72],["section",317.72,318.04],["of",318.04,318.24],["the",318.24,318.34],["parade",318.34,318.72],["all",318.72,319.46],["wore",319.46,319.82],["an",319.82,319.98],["outfit",319.98,320.34],["she",320.34,320.64],["designed.",320.64,321.1]]},{"start":321.7,"end":325.6,"text":"It featured the image of a snake that had no head or tail","words":[["It",321.7,321.86],["featured",321.86,322.18],["the",322.18,322.4],["image",322.4,322.7],["of",322.7,322.98],["a",322.98,323.08],["snake",323.08,323.44],["that",323.44,323.98],["had",323.98,324.22],["no",324.22,324.52],["head",324.52,324.92],["or",324.92,325.2],["tail",325.2,325.6]]},{"start":325.6,"end":328.3,"text":"to represent an ongoing culture.","words":[["to",325.6,326.16],["represent",326.16,326.78],["an",326.78,327.12],["ongoing",327.12,327.64],["culture.",327.64,328.3]]},{"start":329.7,"end":336.84,"text":"Exploitation of creative work can be a problem for any artist and copyright laws exist to","words":[["Exploitation",329.7,330.62],["of",330.62,330.9],["creative",330.9,331.18],["work",331.18,331.74],["can",331.74,332.3],["be",332.3,332.5],["a",332.5,332.64],["problem",332.64,333.06],["for",333.06,333.4],["any",333.4,333.66],["artist",333.66,334.26],["and",334.26,334.92],["copyright",334.92,335.26],["laws",335.26,335.8],["exist",335.8,336.38],["to",336.38,336.84]]},{"start":336.84,"end":342.72,"text":"protect individual artists from the unauthorized use of his or her work.","words":[["protect",336.84,337.32],["individual",337.32,338.06],["artists",338.06,338.6],["from",338.6,339.34],["the",339.34,339.54],["unauthorized",339.54,340.48],["use",340.48,340.84],["of",340.84,341.26],["his",341.26,341.58],["or",341.58,341.94],["her",341.94,342.26],["work.",342.26,342.72]]},{"start":343.7,"end":350.58,"text":"This issue is often more complex for Aboriginal artists as the symbols and motifs used in","words":[["This",343.7,344.16],["issue",344.16,344.64],["is",344.64,344.92],["often",344.92,345.32],["more",345.32,345.56],["complex",345.56,346.14],["for",346.14,346.66],["Aboriginal",346.66,347.1],["artists",347.1,347.9],["as",347.9,348.5],["the",348.5,348.64],["symbols",348.64,349.06],["and",349.06,349.34],["motifs",349.34,349.94],["used",349.94,350.4],["in",350.4,350.58]]},{"start":350.58,"end":354.42,"text":"their designs also hold cultural significance for them.","words":[["their",350.58,350.7],["designs",350.7,351.32],["also",351.32,352.18],["hold",352.18,352.62],["cultural",352.62,353.02],["significance",353.02,353.66],["for",353.66,354.14],["them.",354.14,354.42]]},{"start":354.42,"end":363.96,"text":"An example of this was when a businessman had rugs made overseas incorporating images stolen from Aboriginal paintings.","words":[["An",354.42,355.72],["example",355.72,356.16],["of",356.16,356.36],["this",356.36,356.68],["was",356.68,357.2],["when",357.2,357.42],["a",357.42,357.58],["busin